 me! I'm going to have to hide them! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: The magazine office opens tomorrow as usual. I'm getting a new assignment. This evening I have to stop at my parents' place. Dad is picking up my grandmother at 6.  We're having our yearly family gathering tonight.", "id": 2, "time": "15000", "image": "engenn6le18ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I always chat with my family early Christmas morning. Britain is 5 hours ahead timewise. My sister's always up early with her kids. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: My family does a January 1st event. We only have snacks and open gifts on Christmas Eve. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Are we going to open our gifts? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: First I have to clean up a bit. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'll help.", "id": 3, "time": "37000", "image": "engenn6le18ob03re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le18ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le18ob03re2img03.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}